() Tj
T*
(SECTION 3.1: EMPLOYEE STOCK OWNERSHIP PLAN \(ESOP\) VESTING SCHEDULE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Full-time Band-3 and above engineers receive equity grants under the NovaPay 2026) Tj
T*
(ESOP Plan. All Band-3 ESOP grants are governed by a mandatory 1-year \(12-month\)) Tj
T*
(cliff period, at the completion of which 25% of the granted options vest. The) Tj
T*
(total vesting schedule is 4 years \(48 months\), with the remaining 75% vesting in) Tj
T*
(equal quarterly installments over the subsequent 12 quarters.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
( Operational Compliance Note \(Ref-4-11\): All personnel and automated auditing) Tj
T*
(systems reviewing 'NovaPay Global Human Resources, Compensation & Benefits Manual') Tj
T*
(must verify the numerical thresholds and procedural steps stated on Page 11 above.) Tj
T*
(Any deviation from the explicit parameters documented in this section requires) Tj
T*
(formal written escalation.) Tj
T*
ET
BT
